            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma haze hagende ihema ry’ibonaniro, rijane n’igugu ry’Abalewi, rigendere hagati y’ayandi magugu: uko bakurikirana mu gusagaza, abe ari ko bagenda, umuce wose mu gihimba cawo, ukw’ amabendera yayo akurikirana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
