              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ruhande rw’i burengerazuba haze habe igugu rya Efurayimu, n’ibendera yabo, nk’ukw imice yabo iri; umukuru w’Abefurayimu ni Elishama mwene Amihudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingabo zāharūwe zabo zar’ ibihumbi mirongwine n’amajana atanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
