              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ruhande rw’i burārūko haze habe igugu rya Dani, n’ibendera yabo, nk’ukw imice yabo iri; umukuru w’Abadani ni Ahiyezeri mwene Amishadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
