              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bose na bose abāharūwe mw igugu rya Dani bar’ ingabo ibihumbi ijana na mirongwitanu n’indwi n’amajana atandatu. Abo baze babe ababaherukira mu kugenda, bakurikire amabendera yabo.",
          "type": "text",
