              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bakora kuno; basagaza baherereye ku mabendera yabo; ngo hagere kugenda bakagenda, umuntu wese agakomeza mu bo mu muryango wabo no mu bo mu nzu ya ba sekuruza, bakurikiye ivyo Uhoraho yabariye Mose vyose.",
